diff --git a/anvio/docs/programs/anvi-draw-kegg-pathways.md b/anvio/docs/programs/anvi-draw-kegg-pathways.md
index 195b580497..00a360d0a1 100644
--- a/anvio/docs/programs/anvi-draw-kegg-pathways.md
